        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="entry-stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">200</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Guests Hosted</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">Pan-African</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Guest Travel</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">Full Scope</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Delivery Model</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scope-block">
      <div class="scope-heading">Scope Delivered</div>
      <ul class="scope-list">
        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Venue sourcing</li>
        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Stage design</li>
        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Lighting</li>
        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Catering</li>
        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Entertainment</li>
        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Gifting</li>
        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Digital experience &mdash; e-invites &amp; QR-linked programme</li>
        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Complete on-ground management</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-block">
      <div class="gallery-heading">
        <h3>On the night</h3>
        <span class="gallery-count">5 photographs</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-grid" data-gallery="africa-re">
        <figure><img src="/assets/img/africa-re-sendforth-1.jpg" alt="Main hall and stage" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/assets/img/africa-re-sendforth-2.jpg" alt="Ceremony on the main screen" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/assets/img/africa-re-sendforth-4.jpg" alt="Stage and table settings" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/assets/img/africa-re-sendforth-3.jpg" alt="Branded guest activation" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/assets/img/africa-re-sendforth-5.jpg" alt="Venue build and set construction" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== ENTRY 2 : TAEF ========== -->
<section class="entry" id="taef-afretrade">
  <div class="entry-inner">

    <div class="entry-head">
      <div class="entry-client">TAEF</div>
      <h2 class="entry-title">Afretrade Entrepreneur's Festival</h2>
      <div class="entry-meta">
        <span><i class="fas fa-location-dot"></i> Lagos, Nigeria</span>
        <span><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i> 465K+ total reach</span>
        <span><i class="fas fa-layer-group"></i> 3 delivery pillars</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="entry-hero">
      <img src="/assets/img/taef-afretrade-1.jpg" alt="TAEF Afretrade Entrepreneur's Festival - main stage" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>

    <div class="entry-body">
      <div>
        <div class="detail-box">
          <div class="detail-box-label">Brief</div>
          <div class="detail-box-text">Three high-value pillars of a continental trade and investment summit.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-box">
          <div class="detail-box-label">Delivery</div>
          <div class="detail-box-text">Flagship Gala Night production at The Delborough, official press conference management, and VVIP section coordination at Eko Hotel for heads of state and senior international officials.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-box">
          <div class="detail-box-label">Outcome</div>
          <div class="detail-box-text">465K+ total reach across earned and produced content.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="entry-stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">465K+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Total Media Reach</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">3</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Pillars Delivered</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">Heads of State</div>
          <div class="stat-label">VVIP Section</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-num">01</div>
        <div class="pillar-title">Gala Night Production</div>
        <div class="pillar-text">Flagship Gala Night produced at The Delborough.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-num">02</div>
        <div class="pillar-title">Press Conference</div>
        <div class="pillar-text">Official press conference management for the summit.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-num">03</div>
        <div class="pillar-title">VVIP Coordination</div>
        <div class="pillar-text">VVIP section coordination at Eko Hotel for heads of state and senior international officials.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-block">
      <div class="gallery-heading">
        <h3>From the floor</h3>
        <span class="gallery-count">11 photographs</span>
